    <header class="top">
      <div class="crumb"><span class="jd">25.02</span><span>Field Contracts &amp; MOUs</span><span class="sep">/</span><b>Contracts &amp; work orders</b></div>
      <div class="search"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m16.5 16.5 4 4"/></svg><span>Search everything</span><span class="k">⌘K</span></div>
      <div class="tacts">
        <button class="btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14H6z"/><path d="M9 13h7M9 17h4"/></svg>Export clean + appendix</button>
        <button class="btn p"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>New work order</button>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="phead">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Agreements, commitments and what they consumed</p>
          <h1>WO-2026-041 — Chad facilitator cohort</h1>
          <p class="lede">The agreement is markdown plus typed records; the PDF is an output. The only PDFs that are records here are the counterparty-signed ones, stored with a hash because they came from outside.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sp"></div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:20px">
          <div class="kpi"><span class="l">Contract value</span><span class="v">$186,000</span><span class="d">3 milestones</span></div>
          <div class="kpi"><span class="l">Consumed</span><span class="v">$62,000</span><span class="d">33% · 1 milestone accepted</span></div>
          <div class="kpi"><span class="l">Remaining</span><span class="v">$124,000</span><span class="d">commitment held</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row" style="align-items:flex-start">
        <div style="flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="chd"><h2>Milestones &amp; commitments</h2><div class="r"><span class="b n">a commitment can never exceed contract value</span></div></div>
            <div class="cbd flush">
              <table class="tbl">
                <thead><tr><th>Milestone</th><th>Due</th><th class="num">Value</th><th>Deliverable evidence</th><th>Status</th><th style="width:96px"></th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <sc-for list="{{miles}}" as="m" hint-placeholder-count="3">
                    <tr class="hov">
                      <td style="font-weight:700">{{m.name}}</td>
                      <td class="mono">{{m.due}}</td>
                      <td class="num">{{m.val}}</td>
                      <td><span class="b {{m.evTone}}">{{m.ev}}</span></td>
                      <td><span class="b {{m.tone}}">{{m.status}}</span></td>
                      <td>
                        <sc-if value="{{m.payable}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ true }}">
                          <button class="btn sm p" onClick="{{m.pay}}">Invoice</button>
                        </sc-if>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  </sc-for>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="prov"><span>Partner invoices post against the commitment, releasing it as they clear.</span><span>·</span><span class="mono">commitments · partner_invoices</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="chd">
              <h2>Document</h2>
              <div class="r">
                <div class="seg">
                  <button class="{{rClean}}" onClick="{{setClean}}">Clean</button>
                  <button class="{{rRed}}" onClick="{{setRed}}">Redline</button>
                  <button class="{{rApp}}" onClick="{{setApp}}">Clean + appendix</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cbd" style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.62;color:#3A4A53">
              <p style="margin:0 0 10px"><b>3. Scope.</b> The partner will deliver four training modules to a cohort of twelve facilitators, with community checking sessions
                <sc-if value="{{showRed}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ true }}"><span style="background:#FBE7E7;color:#9B2C2C;text-decoration:line-through">each quarter</span> <span style="background:#E2F3E7;color:#1F6B39">at the close of each module</span></sc-if>
                <sc-if value="{{showClean}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}">at the close of each module</sc-if>.
              </p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 10px"><b>4. Payment.</b> Payment is made against milestone acceptance, not against elapsed time. Travel inside the scope of this work order consumes its commitment and carries its dimensions automatically.</p>
              <p style="margin:0"><b>5. Records.</b> Both parties agree that the platform record, at the version cited in the footer of any exported copy, is the operative text.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="prov"><span class="mono">wo-2026-041@v9</span><span>·</span><span>{{revNote}}</span><span>·</span><span>sha256 <span class="mono">7b02…ce41</span></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="width:330px;flex:0 0 330px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="chd"><h2>Signatures</h2><div class="r"><span class="b {{sigTone}}">{{sigState}}</span></div></div>
            <div class="cbd" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0">
              <sc-for list="{{sigs}}" as="g" hint-placeholder-count="3">
                <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #F1F5F8">
                  <span class="b {{g.tone}}" style="height:17px">{{g.mark}}</span>
                  <div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px">{{g.who}}</div><div style="color:#5A6E7A;font-size:11px;font-weight:600">{{g.note}}</div></div>
                </div>
              </sc-for>
              <button class="{{signCls}}" style="margin-top:10px" onClick="{{sign}}">{{signLabel}}</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="chd"><h2>Dimensions carried</h2></div>
            <div class="cbd" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0">
              <sc-for list="{{dims}}" as="d" hint-placeholder-count="6">
                <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #F1F5F8">
                  <div style="width:104px;flex:0 0 104px;color:#5A6E7A;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700">{{d.k}}</div>
                  <div style="font-weight:600;font-size:12.5px">{{d.v}}</div>
                </div>
              </sc-for>
              <div style="color:#5A6E7A;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;margin-top:9px">Any expense the agent maps to this work order inherits these — which is why a hotel bill lands in the right fund without anyone typing a code.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="chd"><h2>Other agreements</h2></div>
            <div class="cbd flush">
              <sc-for list="{{others}}" as="o" hint-placeholder-count="4">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #E7EEF2">
                  <span class="b {{o.tone}}">{{o.kind}}</span>
                  <div style="min-width:0"><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px">{{o.name}}</div><div style="color:#5A6E7A;font-size:11px;font-weight:600">{{o.note}}</div></div>
                </div>
              </sc-for>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
